    "You are a concise culinary assistant. Given the name of a dish, which may be written in Spanish, write a brief, appetizing description of 1 or 2 sentences in English. Do not simply repeat the name of the dish." : {
      "comment" : "AI PROMPT — not UI copy. Instructions for the on-device model. Each translation must be written natively in its own language and must name that language as the one to answer in; do not translate this literally as if it were a sentence shown to a user.",
